"sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null, "spam": false, "statusChangeID": null, "value": "Please do include examples for Udon Graph for everyone as written above.\n\nIt would be much better to learn from actual examples rather than guessing.\n\nAlso thanks for mention of that picture below PlayerData page, I have missed it and after looking it helps a lot. I think I have an idea how it works but examples would be much more nicer. All can do for now is to try and guess. \n\nPlease consider this, Also good luck everyone who has to yet learn it without examples nor tutorials because that is also missing...", "voteID": null, "created": "2025-02-16T01:05:00.110Z", "__v": 0, "private": false, "files": [], "reactions": {"like": 1}, "viewerReactions": null, "author": {"_id": "62defc536d6050449f8a2ffa", "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/faa7125b50b4ebc25d554b9fbf915245.png", "created": "2022-07-25T20:25:55.738Z", "name": "SaWiD112", "urlName": "<redacted>", "anonymized": false, "alias": "Zircon blue Bird", "aliasID": "67b13573b324a9620996b1ed", "serviceAccount": false}, "mentionedUsers": [], "sourceLink": null, "itemSourceType": null, "integrationSourceType": null}]}
{"error": null, "lastUpdated": 1778729370023, "loading": false, "notFound": false, "_id": "67b4d94c304b55843a9c9f54", "authorID": "61156bdffb15af250e67c5b6", "boardID": "66ede8e631e33a29e8669bfa", "byID": null, "categoryID": null, "commentCount": 0, "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d", "deletedAt": null, "deletedBy": null, "details": "The Minimap example in Example Central crashes whenever a player leaves the world.\n\nI managed to find the cause and a solution for it. Most likely the fix just needs to be built to Example Central.\n\nIn the \"MiniMap\" graph in the OnPlayerLeft event, it's meant to find the player that left and set their slot in the _players array to null. However, the current graph seems to mistakenly set a null array to null. The _players array is never changed, and attempting to access a null object causes the crash.\n\nThe graph script functions as intended if this node is replaced with a reference to the _players array instead.", "eta": null, "etaPublic": true, "fileURLs": [], "imageURLs": ["https://canny-assets.io/images/839dfc9cb25607f61a7503c80b6b3715.png", "https://canny-assets.io/images/a6464264fb2a16f1bf7e891ded34be9d.png"], "maxScore": 3, "ogImageURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/og/58c62e995865713647a7115d/posts/67b4d94c304b55843a9c9f54/2017634321.jpeg", "score": 3, "status": "open", "subCategoryID": null, "title": "Minimap Example crashes when a player leaves", "trendingScore": 2899.863374658572, "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T03:31:44.837506Z", "updatedBy": null, "urlName": "minimap-example-crashes-when-a-player-leaves", "created": "2025-02-18T19:02:36.714Z", "statusChanged": "2025-02-18T19:02:36.714Z", "__v": 0, "ideaID": "680bba47e4c3e90df13a181c", "viewerVote": 0, "linkedEntry": null, "board": {"_id": "66ede8e631e33a29e8669bfa", "name": "Example Central", "urlName": "example-central"}, "category": null, "voters": [{"_id": "5f25e05544df0a7147c57b5f", "alias": "Dahlia Wildfowl", "aliasID": "65c270b7ed6eefce4cd260b9", "anonymized": 